{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;If you're asking about the rumours\u2026&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;It could only be that one, I suppose?&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Actually... the master once had a lover.&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the beginning of the 20th century, in a quiet manor isolated from the turbulent times, a \u201cmaid\u201d, Anna worked diligently every day and led a monotonous and peaceful life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436130/extras/86f8215188a2e9100de0be3bf4a47407.avif?t=1773627864\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, during an unexpected flashback, the gaps in his memory swept over him. Abnormal colleagues, confused gender, empty cognition, vague dreams...the tranquillity in the past was suddenly replaced by a weird atmosphere. While Anna was at a loss, time began to flow. A group of strangers visited the manor, and a long-hidden mystery quietly unfolded. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436130/extras/040e9f40523c201343bcb89aa81e38f4.avif?t=1773627864\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The prologue started. As unexpected yet prearranged events took place after another, the strange visitors who claimed to be the family members of the owner of the manor did not bother to hide their abnormal behaviours. Were the various contradictions in their identities, ages, and relationships related to the uneasiness they showed? Some words that shouldn't exist sounded in Anna's ears. What did they have to do with the story? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The curtain rose, and the requiem of fate began to play. Would &quot;Anna&quot; be pushed to the edge of the unknown, or would he jump into the vortex at the centre of the story?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436130/extras/99f7fcc77337570a9fb611c2a0e3e228.avif?t=1773627864\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436130/extras_big/99f7fcc77337570a9fb611c2a0e3e228.avif?t=1773627864 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2606 Work:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark demons were everywhere in the manor, lurking in the shadows\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must bring them down \u2018with your own hands\u2019! If you are not quick enough, they will rampage throughout the building!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The levels will gradually become more difficult, and more unique mini-games will be unlocked!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There will also be little bonuses hidden in various tasks, waiting for you to discover with attention to details~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436130/extras/0411a4af6b1db1a57a8c0836cb8c6235.avif?t=1773627864\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2606 Map exploration:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As time goes by, different areas in the manor will gradually unlock, awaiting your exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outside your main objective, don't forget to unleash your curiosity. Walk around, and you will find in the corners:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 Interesting conversations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605Characters with secrets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, there\u2019s more\u2b62</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436130/extras/976b78940f08f5222764133e82946c64.avif?t=1773627864\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2606 Case investigation:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Murders occurred frequently within the manor, brewing crisis. Each character had their own secrets, and the truth lay hidden in the subtle clues\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must gather the clues and deduce the process in order to reconstruct the crime scenes and uncover layers of lies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To uncover the truth, or to go with the flow? It all depends on your choices. Don't be deceived by appearances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436130/extras/18d8f20ca123fff4479f3206c4bd2a9a.avif?t=1773627864\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2606 A deductive script packed with layers of clues, with 3 side stories available!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2606 Over 25 CGs and illustrations await your discovery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2606 Cleaning, conversations, map exploration, and even romance with the \u2018NPCs\u2019!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2606 Enjoy the multi-twist story and its complex BL relationships!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2606 The voice actors of the three male leads will bring you the most immersive experience with their versatile voices!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3436130?t=1773627864","