 ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436130/extras/0411a4af6b1db1a57a8c0836cb8c6235.avif?t=1773627864\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2606 Map exploration:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As time goes by, different areas in the manor will gradually unlock, awaiting your exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outside your main objective, don't forget to unleash your curiosity. Walk around, and you will find in the corners:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 Interesting conversations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605Characters with secrets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, there\u2019s more\u2b62</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436130/extras/976b78940f08f5222764133e82946c64.avif?t=1773627864\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2606 Case investigation:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Murders occurred frequently within the manor, brewing crisis. Each character had their own secrets, and the truth lay hidden in the subtle clues\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must gather the clues and deduce the process in order to reconstruct the crime scenes and uncover layers of lies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To uncover the truth, or to go with the flow? It all depends on your choices. Don't be deceived by appearances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436130/extras/18d8f20ca123fff4479f3206c4bd2a9a.avif?t=1773627864\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2606 A deductive script packed with layers of clues, with 3 side stories available!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2606 Over 25 CGs and illustrations await your discovery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2606 Cleaning, conversations, map exploration, and even romance with the \u2018NPCs\u2019!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2606 Enjoy the multi-twist story and its complex BL relationships!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2606 The voice actors of the three male leads will bring you the most immersive experience with their versatile voices!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["\u963f\u9b6f","Playmeow"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436130/75c3ff718f64cdf194e46416fbc274053587d781/header.jpg?t=1773627864","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3436130/504785347/abf91ed2cc6c6d2f5dfd6a585276745937001f60/1770804939/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770805935","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3436130/504785347/abf91ed2cc6c6d2f5dfd6a585276745937001f60/1770804939/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770805935","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3436130/504785347/abf91ed2cc6c6d2f5dfd6a585276745937001f60/1770804939/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1770805935","id":257284263,"name":"PV EN","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257284263/36dd38f16eba66d1b78cf0908f97b8576cc8ca8c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1770805935"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3436130/4335178